dcrafted levels in beautiful and colorful voxel art.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716500/extras/1617f463613f0e2cff7c89675ab6154d.poster.avif?t=1754312197\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716500/extras/1617f463613f0e2cff7c89675ab6154d.webm?t=1754312197\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1716500/extras/1617f463613f0e2cff7c89675ab6154d.mp4?t=1754312197\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Eat the ramen, save the world.<br><br>You'll receive the full game with the 50 levels plus loads of karma points for supporting independent &amp; small-scale developers.",
